    {
      "id": "u_d3cec28e118be0a1d391064a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium sends nothing to an AI provider until you send a message. Enabling the integration, adding a provider or opening a chat transmits nothing on its own, the one exception is that listing a provider's models sends your API key to that provider, so the list can be fetched.",
      "sourceHash": "d3cec28e118be0a1d391064aed3a1607644a87b63c6d73fa1dd51cfd9d030d5d",
      "context": "Privacy",
      "contextHash": "54a57c3147c49f33de5898b87084ad2b14c4ab308f762454bf92aca907478ad5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b6693933b0c055b3f2d5e101_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once you send a message or run the __TRILIUM_PH_0__In-editor AI assistant__TRILIUM_PH_1__, what leaves your machine depends on the provider you chose and on which context options are enabled.",
      "sourceHash": "b6693933b0c055b3f2d5e101578fe5a02af6d34ca1be3d9578d41fe59185b880",
      "context": "Privacy",
      "contextHash": "54a57c3147c49f33de5898b87084ad2b14c4ab308f762454bf92aca907478ad5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
